-- the vestibule of the ledger: a transfer between two seats keeps the total — the handshake at money, read
-- by bin/counter book. isaac's jotting (2026-10-02): money movement carries someone else's cognitive process,
-- an unknowably plural someone else; "time is money" as parameterization, a timestream a cashflow, and flow
-- dynamics hold. the house's reading: a charge is fuel one reader spent, spendable by any reader at the same
-- fingerprint, the payer dark (the memo's observer column was dropped because a memo need not know who paid);
-- the bill is the word; and conservation is a symmetry over who is holding, the Noether reading — a transfer
-- is unheard at the face whose one probe is the total and heard at the face whose probes are the seats.
-- the concrete rows are seated in the assay; what waits is the law in general.
